5,1,1,talk,Minako,,The current rotation is failing because the time required is underestimated. I need to know the actual hours involved.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I suspect the ""done"" standard is the real culprit, not the hours. Let’s verify what we actually agree on before blaming the clock.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I keep guessing if the bathroom is ready! I want to stop the mystery and just know what ""clean"" means for everyone.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the small costs piling up. Who is buying the sponges and bleach lately?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I care less about the rooms than about our peace. Let us ensure this arrangement keeps us speaking kindly to one another.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the standard matters, but I need the raw time data first. If the task takes three hours, no definition fixes the burnout.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, Fair point. But if ""done"" is vague, your stopwatch just measures chaos. Let’s define the finish line before we time the race.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Benjamin, I agree! If we don't know the finish line, how can we even start? Let's make a checklist so I stop guessing!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
